OpenSearch Dashboards: the DQL (Dashboards Query Language) parser and translator
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

backend/wavecore/connectivity/opensearch/dql/ is a Python port of
src/plugins/data/common/opensearch_query/kuery/ in
https://github.com/opensearch-project/OpenSearch-Dashboards at tag 3.8.0
(commit aa72a9818a045ad4e290a5eb9be59e025b90634d).
Modified: rewritten from TypeScript and the PEG.js grammar to Python; each ported
file names its upstream file.

backend/tests/connectivity/opensearch/dql/test_parser.py carries test cases from
kuery_syntax_error.test.ts and ast/ast.test.ts in the same upstream folder and
tag: the syntax error inputs with their messages, and the number literal inputs.
Modified: rewritten from Jest tests to pytest cases.

