-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
kwok: Stage files, the cluster entrypoint and a controller patch (tests only)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

tests/e2e/services/kwok/ builds the Kubernetes cluster the E2E tests run
against, from https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kwok at tag v0.7.0
(commit c04392afe3cc6929cd3cc79f61d8bdcd83a8ba5d). Each file below names its
upstream file.
- stages/node-initialize.yaml, stages/node-heartbeat-with-lease.yaml,
  stages/pod-complete.yaml and stages/pod-delete.yaml are copies of the Stages
  in kustomize/stage/node/fast/, kustomize/stage/node/heartbeat-with-lease/
  and kustomize/stage/pod/fast/.
- stages/pod-ready.yaml is kustomize/stage/pod/fast/pod-ready.yaml with a
  delay, read from a pod annotation, added.
- stages/pod-job-fail.yaml, stages/pod-helm-test-complete.yaml and
  stages/pod-helm-test-fail.yaml are adapted from
  kustomize/stage/pod/fast/pod-complete.yaml; stages/pod-crash-loop.yaml and
  stages/pod-container-creating.yaml are adapted from
  kustomize/stage/pod/fast/pod-ready.yaml.
- entrypoint.sh is adapted from images/cluster/entrypoint.sh.
- kwok-exec-fidelity.patch changes pkg/utils/exec/exec.go; the test image
  applies it when it builds kwok from source.

  Copyright 2022 The Kubernetes Authors. (images/cluster/entrypoint.sh)
  Copyright 2023 The Kubernetes Authors. (pkg/utils/exec/exec.go and the
  kustomize/stage folders)

